    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="84.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 84.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And geselig byð se hyrde ðe ðonne ða heorde into Godes rice ⁊ to heofenlicre myrðe bliðe mot lædan for ærran gewyrhtan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And blessed is the shepherd who then may gladly lead his flock into the kingdom of God and to the joy of Heaven, because of the works which they have wrought.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gesælig byð se hyrde, þe þonne ða heorde into Godes rice ⁊ to heofonlicre myrhþe bliðe mot lædan for ærran gewyrhtan.</ab>
      </div>
